<title>USA: Wall St stocks open higher, techs strong.</title>
<headline>Wall St stocks open higher, techs strong.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. stocks opened higher on Thursday, with Intel Corp and other technology shares propelling the Nasdaq Composite to solid gains.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average was up eight points to 6,411, the Nasdaq Composite up 13 at 1,323 and the S&amp;P Index up two to 743.</p>
<p>The 30-year bond was up 29/32 to yield 6.56 percent.</p>
